    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interesting block match puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370120/extras/260bdf3923a7091d75f773697cd41ac4.poster.avif?t=1734340518\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370120/extras/260bdf3923a7091d75f773697cd41ac4.webm?t=1734340518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370120/extras/260bdf3923a7091d75f773697cd41ac4.mp4?t=1734340518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Two game modes: endless and arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa 600 arcade levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Automatically get a new achievement every 60 seconds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Score leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370120/extras/d269143ed948964905decd84409d7618.avif?t=1734340518\" width=800 height=57 /></span></p>",
